WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.050
Space Explorer started as an easter egg for my apps.

2
00:00:04.050 --> 00:00:05.640
In this case, Sound Shaper.

3
00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:08.745
You'd go to a specific part of the app,

4
00:00:08.745 --> 00:00:12.806
tap a certain combination, and Space Explorer would

5
00:00:12.806 --> 00:00:14.000
open as a game.

6
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:18.481
It was going to have several levels — the sea, space,

7
00:00:18.481 --> 00:00:22.878
a space war — but I took it out to keep Sound Shaper

8
00:00:22.878 --> 00:00:23.470
simple.

9
00:00:23.470 --> 00:00:27.576
Then, months later, we applied to a Platanus hackathon,

10
00:00:27.576 --> 00:00:30.040
and they had an arcade challenge.

11
00:00:30.040 --> 00:00:33.000
I mean: make a video game.

12
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:35.000
And I already had the idea ready, so I went for it.

13
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:39.231
I took it out of my apps, but I used it to apply to the

14
00:00:39.231 --> 00:00:40.000
hackathon.

15
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:46.330
It's basically a 3D space shooter that fits in 50 KB.

16
00:00:46.330 --> 00:00:50.000
I mean, not megabytes: 50 KB.

17
00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:52.000
And honestly, it came out really, really cool.

18
00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:55.110
You can play it right here on this page.

19
00:00:55.110 --> 00:00:58.000
And you can also play it on Platanus's official site.

20
00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:00.448
Right now I don't know if it was the best game,

21
00:01:00.448 --> 00:01:03.000
at least technically — by popular vote it wasn't.

22
00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:07.198
But still, it's a super cool game.
